(11S,12R,14R)-2-Fluoro-14-methyl-11-(methylethyl)spiro[4H-benzo[e]-1,2-thiazine-3,2'-cyclohexane]-1,1-dione,
an Agent for the Electrophilic Asymmetric Fluorination of Aryl Ketone
Enolates
